==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[ti-]]'' (demonstrative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-am]]'' (correlative suffix of time)

===Correlative===
'''tiam'''

# [[then]], at that time (demonstrative correlative of time)

====Usage notes====
When combined with ''[[ĉi]]'', the adverbial particle of proximity, ''tiam ĉi'' means ''at this time''.

====Derived terms====
* [[tiama]]
* {{l|eo|tiamaĵo|gloss=things of that time}}
* {{l|eo|tiamulo|gloss=a contemporary}}

